# Code owners for soroban-cost-estimator.
#
# IMPORTANT: this repository currently has a single maintainer, so CODEOWNERS
# cannot by itself block a merge — GitHub does not let the author of a PR
# satisfy their own required review. See the "solo maintainer" note at the
# bottom of this file and docs/MAINTAINER-CHECKLIST.md for the settings that
# actually do the blocking (ruleset + required status checks).

