# Note on solo-maintainer limits: with one owner, GitHub skips required review
# for that owner's own PRs. Protect main with a ruleset instead — require the
# `build` and `structural scan` status checks for everyone, require a pull
# request for everyone, and never enable ruleset bypass for the owner account.
